<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Saudi Transport Co H1 97 net profit drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Saudi Transport Co H1 97 net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			     (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  63.5  vs     67.2</p>
<p> Operating income	 318.7  vs    317.7</p>
<p> Expenses		   176.0  vs    173.0</p>
<p> Net operating income    60.0  vs     65.4</p>
<p>Shareholders' funds  1,197.5  vs  1,186.5  Assets		   1,892.7  vs  2,030.9</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Public Transport Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based firm provides bus transportation in the kingdom. It is traded on the Saudi market.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
